## 6. Limits kept honest

- The ported column and the ported HUD keep their dev text and Italian literals **on
  the diagnostic path only** (`--ui=legacy`); `game_slice_test.gd` asserts that
  surface, so it is set to the legacy switch rather than rewritten (no assertion deleted).
- `drill` ends stay the drill module's own; only quick/tournament/career matches route
  to the result screen.
- D-pad navigation has no model path in the reference either; the pad is polled once
  per frame like the reference's render loop.
- External feedback is queued only: the host never installs a delivery sender
  (`FeedbackScreen.set_delivery` is the only door), so no audit can submit anything.
